    dcterms:source "Ashlag, Petiḥa le-Ḥokhmat ha-Qabbala, §§1, 6, 32, 100 and 168, Hebrew text of the Jerusalem 1945 printing with the Sulam commentary on the Zohar as given in the Sefaria library (edition from Sefaria's version record; no title page in the text layer)", "Ashlag, Haqdama le-Sefer ha-Zohar, §§6 (ו), 58 (נח), 59 (נט), 60 (ס), 61 (סא) and 62 (סב), Hebrew text of the Sefaria library, version Baal HaSulam's Introduction to Zohar, ed. Zohar HaSulam, 2019 (edition from Sefaria's version record; no title page in the text layer)", "Ashlag, Haqdama le-Talmud Eser ha-Sefirot, §§19 (יט), 30 (ל), 37 (לז), 103 (קג), 148 (קמח), 150 (קנ), 152 (קנב) and 156 (קנו), Hebrew text of the Sefaria library, version Jerusalem, 1956-1966 (edition from Sefaria's version record; no title page in the text layer)", "Ashlag, Talmud Eser ha-Sefirot, Part 1, Histaklut Penimit, ch. 1, para 1 (Sefaria segmentation), Hebrew text of the Sefaria library, version Jerusalem, 1956-1966 (edition from Sefaria's version record; no title page in the text layer)" .
